ejmateriāla veidi</td>\r\n            <td style=\"font-family: Calibri, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(250, 250, 250); padding: 3px; font-size: 14px;\">Zn, PE, PE matt, PURMATT</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"font-family: Calibri, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(238, 238, 238); padding: 3px; font-size: 14px;\">Maksimālais garums</td>\r\n            <td style=\"font-family: Calibri, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(238, 238, 238); padding: 3px; font-size: 14px;\">9 m</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>"}}